Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(job-offers): protect job offer creation and keep
 requirements on edit

- Require session and company role to publish a job offer.
- Validate edits with a schema that keeps unsent requirements unchanged.
- Look up the deleted status through a dedicated repository method.
- Remove the debug log from the delete endpoint.
- Add accents to the validation messages shown to the user.

